# The migrator image's build context is one tar and nothing else (P15-TSK-004).
#
# Why this file is here and not beside the root Dockerfile. The image is a stage of the root Dockerfile, so that its bases
# have one definition, and BuildKit looks for "<dockerfile name>.dockerignore" beside the Dockerfile before anything else.
# A Dockerfile.dockerignore would therefore replace the application's allow-list as well. So the migrator's build names
# this directory as its context (docker buildx build --file Dockerfile --target migrator migrator), and this file is read
# as that context's own .dockerignore. MigratorImageTest holds both halves.
#
# An allow-list, for the application image's reason: it cannot forget anything.
*
!build/image/finapp-migrator.tar
